# Disk Monitoring

Disk monitoring tracks capacity, used space, free space, utilization, read/write operations, and I/O performance.

## Key Points

- Understand the purpose of disk monitoring.
- Identify relevant monitoring measurements.
- Use monitoring information for detection, analysis, and troubleshooting.

## Example Flow

```text
System → Collect Metrics → Analyze → Visualize → Alert → Respond
```
